"这块盘现在是只读的。" = "This disk is read-only right now.";
"推出后重新接上再试一次；仍然只读时，接回 Windows 检查磁盘。" = "Eject it and connect it again. If it’s still read-only, connect it to a Windows PC and check the disk there.";
"这次是按只读方式挂载的。" = "This time the disk was mounted read-only on request.";
"推出后重新接上，就会按盘屿的设置挂载。" = "Eject it and connect it again to mount it the way Volisle is set.";
"盘屿设置成了“默认只读”。" = "Volisle is set to Read-Only by Default.";
"想写入这块盘，在设置里关掉“默认只读”，推出后重新接上。" = "To write to this disk, turn off Read-Only by Default in Settings, then eject the disk and connect it again.";
"磁盘处于写保护状态。" = "The disk is write-protected.";
"检查磁盘、存储卡或读卡器上的写保护开关。" = "Check the write-protect switch on the disk, memory card or card reader.";
"这块盘被标记为需要检查，为保护数据暂时只读。" = "This disk is marked as needing a check, so it stays read-only to protect your data.";
"接回 Windows 检查磁盘，安全弹出后再接回 Mac。" = "Connect it to a Windows PC, check the disk there, eject it safely, then connect it to the Mac again.";
"这块盘来自处于休眠或“快速启动”状态的 Windows，为保护数据暂时只读。" = "This disk comes from a Windows PC that’s hibernated or using Fast Startup, so it stays read-only to protect your data.";
"请在 Windows 中完全关机后再接回 Mac。" = "Shut Windows down completely, then connect the disk to the Mac again.";
"这块盘上次在 Windows 中没有安全弹出，为保护数据暂时只读。" = "This disk wasn’t ejected safely from Windows last time, so it stays read-only to protect your data.";
"接回 Windows，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再接回 Mac。" = "Connect it to a Windows PC, eject it with Safely Remove Hardware, then connect it to the Mac again.";
"上次在这台 Mac 上写入时被打断，自动恢复没有完成，暂时只读。" = "Writing was interrupted on this Mac last time and the automatic recovery didn’t finish, so the disk is read-only for now.";
"无法确认这块盘可以安全写入，暂时只读。" = "Volisle can’t confirm this disk is safe to write to, so it’s read-only for now.";
