"未检测到盘屿文件系统扩展" = "Volisle’s file system extension wasn’t found";
"请把盘屿放在“应用程序”文件夹里，并从那里打开。" = "Keep Volisle in the Applications folder and open it from there.";
"暂时无法读取扩展状态" = "The extension’s status can’t be read right now";
"可以到“系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项与扩展 → 文件系统扩展”里确认“盘屿 NTFS”已经打开。" = "You can check that “Volisle NTFS” is turned on in System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions → File System Extensions.";
"插入 Windows 格式的磁盘" = "Connect a Windows-formatted disk";
"NTFS 磁盘接上后会自动出现在访达里，可以直接读写。" = "An NTFS disk appears in Finder when you connect it, ready to read and write.";
"打开系统设置" = "Open System Settings";
"NTFS · %@" = "NTFS · %@";
"可用 %@，共 %@" = "%@ available of %@";
"容量 %@" = "Capacity %@";
"已用存储空间" = "Used storage";
"在访达中显示" = "Show in Finder";
"推出" = "Eject";
"正在推出" = "Ejecting";
"这块盘还没有挂载。拔下后重新接上，或在“磁盘工具”里选择“装载”。" = "This disk isn’t mounted. Disconnect it and connect it again, or choose Mount in Disk Utility.";
"可以直接在访达里拷贝、修改和删除文件。用完后先推出，再拔下磁盘。" = "Copy, change and delete files right in Finder. When you’re done, eject the disk before unplugging it.";
"这块盘现在由系统挂载，盘屿没有接管它，文件可以照常读取。" = "macOS mounted this disk and Volisle isn’t handling it. You can read its files as usual.";
"如果它是在打开盘屿的扩展之前接上的，推出后重新接上即可。否则说明盘屿打不开这块盘：请接回 Windows 检查磁盘，安全弹出后再接回 Mac。" = "If it was connected before Volisle’s extension was turned on, eject it and connect it again. Otherwise Volisle can’t open this disk: connect it to a Windows PC, check the disk there, eject it safely, then connect it to the Mac again.";
"这块盘现在由系统挂载。打开盘屿的文件系统扩展后重新接上，就可以读写。" = "macOS mounted this disk. Turn on Volisle’s file system extension and connect the disk again to read and write.";
"通用" = "General";
"关于" = "About";
"打开后，接上的 NTFS 磁盘只能读取、不会被写入。已经接着的磁盘要推出后重新接上才会生效。" = "When this is on, NTFS disks you connect can only be read and are never written to. A disk that’s already connected has to be ejected and connected again for the change to apply.";
"默认只读" = "Read-Only by Default";
"盘屿是自由软件，NTFS 读写使用 NTFS-3G。许可证全文和对应源码见上面的链接。" = "Volisle is free software and uses NTFS-3G to read and write NTFS. The full license and the corresponding source code are at the link above.";
"版本" = "Version";
"源代码与开源许可（GNU GPL v2）" = "Source Code and License (GNU GPL v2)";
"官网版盘屿" = "Website version of Volisle";
"这块盘现在由官网版盘屿挂载，读写和推出请在官网版里操作。" = "The website version of Volisle mounted this disk. Use that version to read, write and eject it.";
"两个版本不需要同时使用。想改用这个版本，先在官网版里推出这块盘并退出官网版，再重新接上。" = "You don’t need both versions at once. To use this one instead, eject the disk in the website version, quit it, then connect the disk again.";
"打开文件系统扩展，开始读写 NTFS 磁盘" = "Turn on the file system extension to read and write NTFS disks";
"盘屿通过 macOS 的文件系统扩展读写磁盘，需要在系统设置里打开一次。" = "Volisle reads and writes disks through a macOS file system extension, which has to be turned on once in System Settings.";
"点下面的“打开系统设置”。" = "Click Open System Settings below.";
"在“文件系统扩展”列表里打开“盘屿 NTFS”。" = "Turn on “Volisle NTFS” in the File System Extensions list.";
"回到盘屿。已经接着的磁盘，推出后重新接上。" = "Come back to Volisle. If a disk is already connected, eject it and connect it again.";
"没有自动跳到这个列表时，它在“系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项与扩展 → 文件系统扩展”。" = "If the list doesn’t open by itself, it’s in System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions → File System Extensions.";
"已经在“应用程序”文件夹里时，退出盘屿后重新打开；仍然没有的话，重新启动 Mac。" = "If it’s already in the Applications folder, quit Volisle and open it again. If that doesn’t help, restart the Mac.";
"这台 Mac 上还装着官网版盘屿" = "The website version of Volisle is also installed on this Mac";
"两个版本只用一个就够了。同时使用时，磁盘可能被另一个版本接走，出现推出失败。不用官网版的话，先在它的设置里移除后台组件，再把它移到废纸篓。" = "You only need one version. If both are in use, a disk may be handed to the other version and then fail to eject. If you no longer use the website version, remove its background component in its settings, then move it to the Trash.";
"不再提示" = "Don’t Show Again";
"请检查最近拷贝或修改的文件，没有的重新拷贝一次。" = "Check the files you copied or changed most recently, and copy again any that are missing.";
"上次读写这块盘时被中断了（盘屿更新、磁盘被拔下或断电都会这样），最后约 20 秒写入的内容已退回，磁盘恢复到了中断前的一致状态。" = "Reading and writing this disk was interrupted last time (an update of Volisle, unplugging the disk or a power loss all do this). What was written in the last 20 seconds or so was undone, and the disk is back in the consistent state it had before.";
"上次推出后磁盘拔得太快，最后的改动还没写进磁盘，已退回到推出前的一致状态。" = "The disk was unplugged too soon after it was ejected last time, before it had written out the last changes. It’s back in the consistent state it had before.";
"盘屿更新时会中断正在读写的磁盘，更新前请先推出。" = "Updating Volisle interrupts any disk it’s reading or writing, so eject your disks before you update.";
"更新" = "Updates";
"盘屿更新时，系统会先结束它的文件系统扩展：正在读写的磁盘会像被拔下一样中断，最后约 20 秒写入的内容会退回。更新前请先推出磁盘。" = "When Volisle is updated, macOS first ends its file system extension. A disk it’s reading or writing is interrupted as if it were unplugged, and what was written in the last 20 seconds or so is undone. Eject your disks before you update.";
"如果你经常长时间读写磁盘，可以在 App Store 的设置里关闭自动更新，改成用完磁盘后手动更新。" = "If you often use disks for long stretches, you can turn off automatic updates in the App Store settings and update by hand once you’re done with your disks.";

